Additional third-party notices
------------------------------

core/colormap_matlab.py contains the magma, inferno, plasma and viridis
colormap data by Nathaniel J. Smith, Stefan van der Walt and Eric Firing,
released under the CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication, and the parula
colormap approximation distributed with matplotlib (matplotlib license).

core/montage_utils.py adapts image-montage helpers from imutils by Adrian
Rosebrock and Kyle Hounslow (MIT License) and torchvision (BSD 3-Clause).

scripts/synthesis/ vendors a snapshot of prj_control_fa by Thomas Fel; its
license and upstream commit are recorded in scripts/synthesis/PROVENANCE.md.
